    "go-validator-block-and-cert-rules": {
      "statement": "Beyond the required-field rules recorded in the SDK defects, the Go validator also rejects a `DECRYPT` rule that sets `showEUN` or `showEUNATP`, a `BLOCK` rule that carries either sub-action block or sets `showEUNATP`, and a `DECRYPT` or `BLOCK` rule with `overrideDefaultCertificate` false that attaches `sslInterceptionCert`.",
